isofill (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Work band by band above --max-mem, so a whole zone at 1 arcsecond fits:
    the summed area table alone is 42 GB for an 86401x39601 raster.
  * --mask bounds where cells may be filled, without narrowing what any cell
    can see, so a zone-wide run no longer invents terrain across unmapped
    squares.
  * Default to all but two cores rather than every core.

 -- Lee Kindness <wangi@opengeofiction.net>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 17:00:00 +0000

